    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "# Complete LLM Process — Start to End\n",
        "\n",
        "An LLM (Large Language Model) has **two major processes**:\n",
        "\n",
        "1. **Training:** How the model learns.\n",
        "2. **Inference:** How the trained model generates answers.\n",
        "\n",
        "It may also undergo **post-training** to make it more helpful and follow instructions.\n",
        "\n",
        "---\n",
        "\n",
        "# A. LLM TRAINING — HOW THE MODEL LEARNS\n",
        "\n",
        "```text\n",
        "                 ┌──────────────────────────┐\n",
        "                 │     1. TRAINING DATA     │\n",
        "                 │ Books, websites, code,   │\n",
        "                 │ articles, conversations  │\n",
        "                 └────────────┬─────────────┘\n",
        "                              │\n",
        "                              ▼\n",
        "                 ┌──────────────────────────┐\n",
        "                 │  2. TOKENIZATION         │\n",
        "                 │ Text → Tokens → Token IDs│\n",
        "                 └────────────┬─────────────┘\n",
        "                              │\n",
        "                              ▼\n",
        "                 ┌──────────────────────────┐\n",
        "                 │  3. EMBEDDING LOOKUP     │\n",
        "                 │ Token IDs → Vectors      │\n",
        "                 │ (learned numbers)        │\n",
        "                 └────────────┬─────────────┘\n",
        "                              │\n",
        "                              ▼\n",
        "                 ┌──────────────────────────┐\n",
        "                 │  4. POSITIONAL           │\n",
        "                 │     INFORMATION          │\n",
        "                 │ Helps represent token    │\n",
        "                 │ order and position       │\n",
        "                 └────────────┬─────────────┘\n",
        "                              │\n",
        "                              ▼\n",
        "          ┌──────────────────────────────────────┐\n",
        "          │       5. TRANSFORMER LAYERS          │\n",
        "          │                                      │\n",
        "          │  ┌────────────────────────────────┐  │\n",
        "          │  │ A. Self-Attention               │  │\n",
        "          │  │                                │  │\n",
        "          │  │ • Query (Q)                     │  │\n",
        "          │  │ • Key (K)                       │  │\n",
        "          │  │ • Value (V)                     │  │\n",
        "          │  │ • Attention scores              │  │\n",
        "          │  │ • Attention weights              │  │\n",
        "          │  │ • Contextual information         │  │\n",
        "          │  └───────────────┬────────────────┘  │\n",
        "          │                  ▼                   │\n",
        "          │  ┌────────────────────────────────┐  │\n",
        "          │  │ B. Residual Connection          │  │\n",
        "          │  │    + Layer Normalization        │  │\n",
        "          │  └───────────────┬────────────────┘  │\n",
        "          │                  ▼                   │\n",
        "          │  ┌────────────────────────────────┐  │\n",
        "          │  │ C. Feed-Forward Network (FFN)   │  │\n",
        "          │  │    + Activation Function        │  │\n",
        "          │  └───────────────┬────────────────┘  │\n",
        "          │                  ▼                   │\n",
        "          │  ┌────────────────────────────────┐  │\n",
        "          │  │ D. Residual Connection          │  │\n",
        "          │  │    + Layer Normalization        │  │\n",
        "          │  └────────────────────────────────┘  │\n",
        "          │                                      │\n",
        "          │  Repeat through multiple layers      │\n",
        "          └──────────────────┬───────────────────┘\n",
        "                             │\n",
        "                             ▼\n",
        "                 ┌──────────────────────────┐\n",
        "                 │ 6. LINEAR OUTPUT LAYER   │\n",
        "                 │ Produces logits for      │\n",
        "                 │ possible next tokens     │\n",
        "                 └────────────┬─────────────┘\n",
        "                              │\n",
        "                              ▼\n",
        "                 ┌──────────────────────────┐\n",
        "                 │ 7. SOFTMAX               │\n",
        "                 │ Logits → Probabilities   │\n",
        "                 └────────────┬─────────────┘\n",
        "                              │\n",
        "                              ▼\n",
        "                 ┌──────────────────────────┐\n",
        "                 │ 8. NEXT-TOKEN PREDICTION │\n",
        "                 │ Compare prediction with  │\n",
        "                 │ the correct next token   │\n",
        "                 └────────────┬─────────────┘\n",
        "                              │\n",
        "                              ▼\n",
        "                 ┌──────────────────────────┐\n",
        "                 │ 9. LOSS CALCULATION      │\n",
        "                 │ Cross-entropy loss       │\n",
        "                 │ Measures prediction error│\n",
        "                 └────────────┬─────────────┘\n",
        "                              │\n",
        "                              ▼\n",
        "                 ┌──────────────────────────┐\n",
        "                 │ 10. BACKPROPAGATION      │\n",
        "                 │ Calculates gradients     │\n",
        "                 │ for model parameters      │\n",
        "                 └────────────┬─────────────┘\n",
        "                              │\n",
        "                              ▼\n",
        "                 ┌──────────────────────────┐\n",
        "                 │ 11. OPTIMIZER UPDATE     │\n",
        "                 │ Example: Adam             │\n",
        "                 │ Updates model weights     │\n",
        "                 └────────────┬─────────────┘\n",
        "                              │\n",
        "                              ▼\n",
        "                 ┌──────────────────────────┐\n",
        "                 │ 12. REPEAT TRAINING      │\n",
        "                 │ Process many examples     │\n",
        "                 │ over many training steps │\n",
        "                 └────────────┬─────────────┘\n",
        "                              │\n",
        "                              └───────┐\n",
        "                                      │\n",
        "                    Repeat forward pass,\n",
        "                    loss, backpropagation,\n",
        "                    and weight updates\n",
        "                                      │\n",
        "                                      ▼\n",
        "                           TRAINED BASE MODEL\n",
        "```\n",
        "\n",
        "**Important:** During training, the model's weights—including its embedding vectors, attention parameters, and feed-forward parameters—are adjusted to improve predictions.\n",
        "\n",
        "---\n",
        "\n",
        "# B. LLM INFERENCE — HOW THE MODEL ANSWERS YOU\n",
        "\n",
        "Inference happens when you send a message to an already-trained model.\n",
        "\n",
        "```text\n",
        "                  ┌──────────────────────────┐\n",
        "                  │ 1. USER INPUT            │\n",
        "                  │ \"What is AI?\"             │\n",
        "                  └────────────┬─────────────┘\n",
        "                               │\n",
        "                               ▼\n",
        "                  ┌──────────────────────────┐\n",
        "                  │ 2. TOKENIZER             │\n",
        "                  │ Text → Tokens → IDs      │\n",
        "                  └────────────┬─────────────┘\n",
        "                               │\n",
        "                               ▼\n",
        "                  ┌──────────────────────────┐\n",
        "                  │ 3. EMBEDDING LOOKUP      │\n",
        "                  │ IDs → Learned vectors    │\n",
        "                  └────────────┬─────────────┘\n",
        "                               │\n",
        "                               ▼\n",
        "                  ┌──────────────────────────┐\n",
        "                  │ 4. POSITIONAL            │\n",
        "                  │    INFORMATION           │\n",
        "                  │ Represent token order    │\n",
        "                  └────────────┬─────────────┘\n",
        "                               │\n",
        "                               ▼\n",
        "          ┌──────────────────────────────────────┐\n",
        "          │       5. TRANSFORMER LAYERS          │\n",
        "          │                                      │\n",
        "          │ Self-Attention                       │\n",
        "          │    ↓                                 │\n",
        "          │ Q, K, V calculations                 │\n",
        "          │    ↓                                 │\n",
        "          │ Attention scores and weights         │\n",
        "          │    ↓                                 │\n",
        "          │ Combine relevant token information   │\n",
        "          │    ↓                                 │\n",
        "          │ Residual Connections + Normalization │\n",
        "          │    ↓                                 │\n",
        "          │ Feed-Forward Network                 │\n",
        "          │    ↓                                 │\n",
        "          │ Repeat through multiple layers       │\n",
        "          └──────────────────┬───────────────────┘\n",
        "                             │\n",
        "                             ▼\n",
        "                  ┌──────────────────────────┐\n",
        "                  │ 6. OUTPUT PROJECTION     │\n",
        "                  │ Final representations    │\n",
        "                  │ → Logits                 │\n",
        "                  └────────────┬─────────────┘\n",
        "                               │\n",
        "                               ▼\n",
        "                  ┌──────────────────────────┐\n",
        "                  │ 7. PROBABILITY            │\n",
        "                  │    CALCULATION            │\n",
        "                  │ Softmax → Token           │\n",
        "                  │ probabilities             │\n",
        "                  └────────────┬─────────────┘\n",
        "                               │\n",
        "                               ▼\n",
        "                  ┌──────────────────────────┐\n",
        "                  │ 8. DECODING              │\n",
        "                  │ Select the next token    │\n",
        "                  │                          │\n",
        "                  │ • Greedy decoding        │\n",
        "                  │ • Sampling               │\n",
        "                  │ • Temperature            │\n",
        "                  │ • Top-k                  │\n",
        "                  │ • Top-p                  │\n",
        "                  └────────────┬─────────────┘\n",
        "                               │\n",
        "                               ▼\n",
        "                  ┌──────────────────────────┐\n",
        "                  │ 9. APPEND SELECTED TOKEN │\n",
        "                  │ Add token to context     │\n",
        "                  └────────────┬─────────────┘\n",
        "                               │\n",
        "                               ▼\n",
        "                  ┌──────────────────────────┐\n",
        "                  │ 10. GENERATE NEXT TOKEN  │\n",
        "                  │ Process updated context  │\n",
        "                  │ to predict another token │\n",
        "                  └────────────┬─────────────┘\n",
        "                               │\n",
        "                               └───────────┐\n",
        "                                           │\n",
        "                              Repeat until a\n",
        "                              stopping condition\n",
        "                              is reached\n",
        "                                           │\n",
        "                                           ▼\n",
        "                              ┌─────────────────────┐\n",
        "                              │ 11. DETOKENIZATION  │\n",
        "                              │ Token IDs → Text    │\n",
        "                              └──────────┬──────────┘\n",
        "                                         │\n",
        "                                         ▼\n",
        "                              ┌─────────────────────┐\n",
        "                              │ 12. FINAL RESPONSE  │\n",
        "                              │ \"AI is...\"          │\n",
        "                              └─────────────────────┘\n",
        "```\n",
        "\n",
        "### What happens during inference?\n",
        "\n",
        "- The model uses its **existing learned weights**.\n",
        "- It calculates the next-token probabilities.\n",
        "- It selects a token and uses it to continue generating the response.\n",
        "- This repeats until the response is complete.\n",
        "- **Ordinary inference does not update the model's weights.**\n",
        "\n",
        "---\n",
        "\n",
        "# C. POST-TRAINING — HOW THE MODEL BECOMES MORE USEFUL\n",
        "\n",
        "After pretraining, models may undergo additional training.\n",
        "\n",
        "```text\n",
        "                ┌──────────────────────────┐\n",
        "                │ 1. PRETRAINING            │\n",
        "                │ Learn language patterns,  │\n",
        "                │ facts, and representations│\n",
        "                └────────────┬─────────────┘\n",
        "                             │\n",
        "                             ▼\n",
        "                ┌──────────────────────────┐\n",
        "                │ 2. SUPERVISED            │\n",
        "                │    FINE-TUNING (SFT)      │\n",
        "                │ Learn from example        │\n",
        "                │ instructions and answers  │\n",
        "                └────────────┬─────────────┘\n",
        "                             │\n",
        "                             ▼\n",
        "                ┌──────────────────────────┐\n",
        "                │ 3. PREFERENCE TRAINING   │\n",
        "                │ Learn which responses    │\n",
        "                │ people prefer             │\n",
        "                └────────────┬─────────────┘\n",
        "                             │\n",
        "                             ▼\n",
        "                ┌──────────────────────────┐\n",
        "                │ 4. ALIGNMENT METHODS     │\n",
        "                │                          │\n",
        "                │ • RLHF                   │\n",
        "                │ • DPO                    │\n",
        "                │ • Other optimization     │\n",
        "                │   approaches             │\n",
        "                └────────────┬─────────────┘\n",
        "                             │\n",
        "                             ▼\n",
        "                ┌──────────────────────────┐\n",
        "                │ MORE HELPFUL LLM         │\n",
        "                │ Better instruction       │\n",
        "                │ following and responses  │\n",
        "                └──────────────────────────┘\n",
        "```\n",
        "\n",
        "**Note:** These stages vary by model. Reinforcement learning is not mandatory for every LLM, and DPO is a preference-optimization method that does not require traditional reinforcement learning.\n",
        "\n",
        "---\n",
        "\n",
        "# D. IMPORTANT COMPONENTS YOU SHOULD KNOW\n",
        "\n",
        "| Component | What it does |\n",
        "|---|---|\n",
        "| **Tokenizer** | Splits text into tokens and maps them to IDs. |\n",
        "| **Token IDs** | Numerical identifiers representing tokens. |\n",
        "| **Embedding layer** | Maps token IDs to learned vectors. |\n",
        "| **Positional information** | Helps represent the order of tokens. |\n",
        "| **Transformer** | The neural network architecture used by many LLMs. |\n",
        "| **Self-attention** | Helps tokens incorporate information from other tokens. |\n",
        "| **Query (Q)** | Represents what information a token is seeking in attention. |\n",
        "| **Key (K)** | Helps determine how relevant a token is to a query. |\n",
        "| **Value (V)** | Carries information combined using attention weights. |\n",
        "| **Multi-head attention** | Uses multiple attention heads to learn different relationships. |\n",
        "| **Feed-forward network** | Further transforms token representations. |\n",
        "| **Residual connection** | Helps information and gradients flow through deep networks. |\n",
        "| **Layer normalization** | Helps stabilize network computations. |\n",
        "| **Logits** | Raw scores for possible next tokens. |\n",
        "| **Softmax** | Converts logits into a probability distribution. |\n",
        "| **Decoding** | Chooses the next token from the model's output distribution. |\n",
        "| **Loss function** | Measures how far predictions are from training targets. |\n",
        "| **Backpropagation** | Calculates gradients used to improve model parameters. |\n",
        "| **Optimizer** | Uses gradients to update parameters. |\n",
        "| **SFT** | Fine-tunes the model using examples of desired behavior. |\n",
        "| **RLHF** | Uses human preferences and reinforcement learning in certain training pipelines. |\n",
        "| **DPO** | Directly optimizes model behavior using preference data. |\n",
        "\n",
        "---\n",
        "\n",
        "# E. THE COMPLETE LLM PIPELINE IN ONE DIAGRAM\n",
        "\n",
        "```text\n",
        "                    ┌───────────────────┐\n",
        "                    │   TRAINING DATA    │\n",
        "                    └─────────┬─────────┘\n",
        "                              ▼\n",
        "                    ┌───────────────────┐\n",
        "                    │   TOKENIZATION     │\n",
        "                    └─────────┬─────────┘\n",
        "                              ▼\n",
        "                    ┌───────────────────┐\n",
        "                    │    EMBEDDINGS      │\n",
        "                    └─────────┬─────────┘\n",
        "                              ▼\n",
        "                    ┌───────────────────┐\n",
        "                    │ POSITIONAL INFO    │\n",
        "                    └─────────┬─────────┘\n",
        "                              ▼\n",
        "                    ┌───────────────────┐\n",
        "                    │   TRANSFORMER      │\n",
        "                    │                   │\n",
        "                    │ • Attention       │\n",
        "                    │ • Feed-forward    │\n",
        "                    │ • Residuals       │\n",
        "                    │ • Normalization   │\n",
        "                    └─────────┬─────────┘\n",
        "                              ▼\n",
        "                    ┌───────────────────┐\n",
        "                    │ LOGITS + SOFTMAX   │\n",
        "                    └─────────┬─────────┘\n",
        "                              ▼\n",
        "                    ┌───────────────────┐\n",
        "                    │ NEXT-TOKEN LOSS    │\n",
        "                    └─────────┬─────────┘\n",
        "                              ▼\n",
        "                    ┌───────────────────┐\n",
        "                    │ BACKPROPAGATION    │\n",
        "                    └─────────┬─────────┘\n",
        "                              ▼\n",
        "                    ┌───────────────────┐\n",
        "                    │ OPTIMIZER UPDATE   │\n",
        "                    └─────────┬─────────┘\n",
        "                              │\n",
        "                              └───────► Repeat\n",
        "                              ▼\n",
        "                       TRAINED MODEL\n",
        "                              │\n",
        "                    Optional post-training\n",
        "                    (SFT, RLHF, DPO, etc.)\n",
        "                              │\n",
        "                              ▼\n",
        "                       DEPLOYED LLM\n",
        "                              │\n",
        "                       User sends input\n",
        "                              ▼\n",
        "                    ┌───────────────────┐\n",
        "                    │   TOKENIZATION     │\n",
        "                    └─────────┬─────────┘\n",
        "                              ▼\n",
        "                    ┌───────────────────┐\n",
        "                    │    EMBEDDINGS      │\n",
        "                    └─────────┬─────────┘\n",
        "                              ▼\n",
        "                    ┌───────────────────┐\n",
        "                    │ POSITIONAL INFO    │\n",
        "                    └─────────┬─────────┘\n",
        "                              ▼\n",
        "                    ┌───────────────────┐\n",
        "                    │   TRANSFORMER      │\n",
        "                    │ Attention + FFN    │\n",
        "                    └─────────┬─────────┘\n",
        "                              ▼\n",
        "                    ┌───────────────────┐\n",
