        "                    └─────────┬─────────┘\n",
        "                              │\n",
        "                              └───────► Repeat\n",
        "                              ▼\n",
        "                    ┌───────────────────┐\n",
        "                    │  FINAL TEXT OUTPUT │\n",
        "                    └───────────────────┘\n",
        "```\n",
        "\n",
        "### Remember these three things\n",
        "\n",
        "1. **Training:** The model learns by predicting tokens, calculating loss, computing gradients, and updating weights.\n",
        "2. **Inference:** The model uses its learned weights to predict and generate tokens.\n",
        "3. **Attention:** Attention operates *inside the Transformer layers*; it is not a separate stage before or after the Transformer.\n",
        "\n",
        "**Your next learning step:** Understand **self-attention mathematically**—how Query, Key, and Value vectors produce attention scores and how those scores determine which information each token receives."
